From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] VU: compiled VU1 and VU0 microprograms

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0034: Compiled VU1 microprogram runtime
- 0035: VU program compiler and tests
- 0036: Compile VU0 microprograms with the VU1 program compiler
- 0037: Test compiled VU0 programs against the interpreter
- 0038: Hand in-flight VU results back in the interpreter's own view
- 0039: Record VU0 register jump targets while profiling
- 0040: Make a VU0 macro call cheaper: no reset, clear only what is in use
- 0041: Commit compiled-routine flags without a branch per result
---
